# The wrapper is part of the source: without gradlew, gradlew.bat and gradle-wrapper.jar a
# fresh clone cannot build, and a build that only works on the author's machine is not
# reproducible. The properties file pins both the distribution and its SHA-256.

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/docs/deployment/android#reference-the-keystore-from-the-app
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.p12
